rvice/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4661070,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1846651706691362","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"HANDS OVER Joins Steam Next Fest!","summary":"STEAM NEXT FEST IS HERE! Steam Next Fest has officially kicked off, and HANDS OVER is ready to bring the chaos! The Demo is LIVE, and it's time to get your crew together, jump in, and find out whether your teamwork is actually as good as you think it is. Expect chaotic situations, desperate coordination, and plenty of moments where everything goes completely wrong. Think your team can handle it? There's only one way to find out. Don't have enough friends to fill your squad? No problem! Head over","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691362","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1846651706678053","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"HANDS OVER Demo Is Now Live!","summary":"HANDS OVER Demo Is Now Live! The wait is over! The HANDS OVER Demo is officially available on Steam. Gather your friends, jump into the game, and get ready for some chaotic teamwork. Work together, coordinate your moves, and see if your friendship can survive the experience. Don't have anyone to play with? No problem! Join our official Discord server, find other players, and put your teamwork to the test together. Whether you're bringing your own squad or looking for new teammates, now's the per","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:00:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1846018067941042","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"HANDS OVER - Demo coming on October 15","summary":"The wait is almost over! We're excited to announce that HANDS OVER is joining Steam Next Fest from October 19 to 26! But you won't have to wait until the festival to get your hands on the game - our free demo launches on October 15, giving you the chance to try it out early 🎮 Try the Free Demo Starting October 15, you can jump into HANDS OVER and discover what happens when innocent-looking challenges turn into a nightmare for your hands and friendships. HANDS OVER is a co-op horror game for up t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:00:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941042","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1846018067933394","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"HANDS OVER IS COMING ON 30 OCTOBER!","summary":"HANDS OVER IS COMING! THE WAIT IS ALMOST OVER! Are you ready for Halloween? Because we are more than ready. After months of development, playtesting, feedback, and a whole lot of work behind the scenes, HANDS OVER is finally getting ready for release! HANDS OVER will officially launch on October 30! We want to say a huge thank you to everyone who has been following the game, added it to their wishlist, joined our playtest, filled out our surveys, shared feedback, made content, or simply told a f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T14:00:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933394","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1844115010491082","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"HANDS OVER Is Coming to Early Access","summary":"Well.Looks like it’s time to open the doors a little wider.After the playtests, your feedback, plenty of suspicious decisions, and even more moments of “it wasn’t me,” we’ve decided what comes next.HANDS OVER is coming to Early Access soon.For us, this is the best way to keep developing the game together with you.HANDS OVER already has everything you need to gather your friends around the table and start doubting them almost immediately.Bluffing. Sabotage. Mini-games. Risk. And those moments whe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T07:05:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010491082","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1842212951313588","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"100,000 WISHLISTS! ❤️ PLAYTEST CLOSED!","summary":"HANDS OVER has reached 100,000 wishlists!Thank you to everyone who added the game to their wishlist, has been following the project and is waiting for more news.A special thank you to everyone who took part in the playtest and filled out the surveys. We read your answers, feedback, and suggestions, and they help us a lot as we continue working on the game.And, of course, a huge thank you to all the influencers and content creators who shared HANDS OVER with their audiences.Originally, we planned","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T14:35:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951313588","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1840944183773989","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"You’ve Waited Long Enough.","summary":"The HANDS OVER playtest is starting.And it’s going to be extremely limited.Right now, we’re letting in a small first wave of players so we can closely watch the feedback, test the game in real conditions, and see how everything holds up.How many more players will get access?We don’t know yet.We’ll see how the first wave goes, how active you are, and what kind of feedback we get. After that, we may open the doors to more players.So if you haven’t received access yet, don’t go too far.Keep an eye ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T13:28:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773989","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1839041357029658","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"A New Milestone: 80,000 Wishlists!","summary":"80,000! Today we crossed 80,000 wishlists And somehow... we're now sitting around #800 on Steam's Most Wishlisted ranking That's honestly wild Thank you to every single person who's wishlisted the game, shared it with friends, left feedback, or simply followed our journey You're the reason we keep pushing harder every day. We're actively working on the game, and the next few weeks are going to be exciting We have some really big news to share soon Stay tuned We're just getting started! ❤️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T14:00:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357029658","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1836506165576187","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"06.07. 67,067 wishlists. Wait, what?","summary":"Today is 06.07.And we have 67,067 wishlists.Honestly, we have no idea how it lined up this well.Thank you to everyone who wishlisted the game, follows the news, and helps the project grow.And yes, a playtest is coming soon.A very closed one. Only around 300 players will get in.So stay active, keep an eye on the posts, and don’t miss the next updates.67,067 on 06.07. The meme wrote itself.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T15:12:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165576187","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1834602721199067","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"We Accidentally Made Some Noise","summary":"We have two pieces of news.First: somehow, HANDS OVER ended up in the SteamDB top 100.Second: we are still not entirely sure how that happened.For a little while, the game reached #61 on SteamDB and our reaction was basically:“Wait... what?”No, we did not hack Steam. No, we do not have any secret tricks. Yes, it looked very strange.It seems SteamDB had a small moment and briefly placed HANDS OVER next to some very serious projects.But if the top 100 appearance was a bug, your support definitely ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T14:35:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721199067","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1833968530899849","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"HANDS OVER at The MIX Summer Game Showcase 2026","summary":"Hello, friends!We’re excited to share some big news: HANDS OVER was featured at The MIX Summer Game Showcase, where we revealed an exclusive trailer for our new game.You can watch the full showcase here: This is an important milestone for us, and we truly appreciate your activity, comments, wishlists, and interest in the project. Seeing your curiosity and support for the game motivates us to move faster, pay even more attention to the details and make HANDS OVER even better.Right now, our team i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T09:24:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530899849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661070-1833968530884718","game_id":"steam-4661070","kind":"announcement","title":"HANDS OVER is now on Steam!","summary":"Hello, friends!We have an important announcement: the HANDS OVER Steam page is now live.This is a big new project for our team, where familiar tabletop mini-games become much darker. Take a seat at the table, make your move, use influence cards, bluff, sabotage your friends and try to be the last one standing.Press the next tooth? Trust a friend who “definitely didn’t set anything up”? Play it safe or take the risk?In HANDS OVER, every round can quickly turn into chaos, and one wrong choice can ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-27T08:10:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530884718","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4661070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:50Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4661070":"2026-10-26T03:18:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4661070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-1